  "school": {
    "source": "上海戏剧学院转载沈琦华《红楼映烽火 楼宇铸艺魂》，《新民晚报》",
    "url": "https://wmzx.sta.edu.cn/e5/a2/c3731a124322/page.htm",
    "sha256": "cf8d2370209d609cb35473ed0c20b5fa18c93ba9e5334b38a5ba82a2e12cbfe1",
    "reading": "1930年代，原外侨俱乐部；校方辨认为青红砖墙、四坡顶、围廊列柱。1945年后电影制片的使用史未用于还原室内。"
  },
  "photographs": [
    {
      "photographer": "Legolas1024",
      "commons": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%86%8A%E4%BD%9B%E8%A5%BF%E6%A5%BC%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E6%88%8F%E5%89%A7%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89.jpg",
      "original": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/%E7%86%8A%E4%BD%9B%E8%A5%BF%E6%A5%BC%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E6%88%8F%E5%89%A7%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2%EF%BC%89.jpg",
      "date": "2014-08-02 15:06:39",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "width": 1350,
      "height": 900,
      "sha256": "2ead22d5c35ad6c6e25db9b976bc5298c6dcc24a4fca60756d94492d48e82c6f",
      "reading": "东南斜视长面与短边，右端外角贯层柱、三条主结构线、上下铁栏、二层楼板前百叶和转侧的基座圆孔可定位。"
    },
    {
      "photographer": "Antigng",
      "commons": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%8A%E6%88%8F.jpg",
      "original": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/79/%E4%B8%8A%E6%88%8F.jpg",
      "date": "2014-05-21 17:27:50",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "width": 2560,
      "height": 1920,
      "sha256": "1b2c025219ec224c273fb4fd4bbc947d2e590e208183be06ebbcb3b38d75a34b",
      "reading": "较平的南面照，树叶与车遮挡低处；可区分南长廊木撑、围栏、墙面和退后的窗组。"
    }
  ],
